## Monorepo structure

```text
apps/web              {{frontend framework}} dashboard
apps/api              {{backend framework}} backend
packages/db            Drizzle schema + migrations + db client
packages/shared-types  Types shared across apps
packages/validation    Zod schemas shared between api and web forms
packages/storage       Storage provider abstraction
```

